{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13760","headline":"梁司马画马歌 · 顾况","name":"梁司马画马歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画精神，画筋骨，一团旋风瞥灭没。\n仰秣如上贺兰山，低头欲饮长城窟。\n此马昂然独此羣，阿爷是龙飞入云。\n黄沙枯碛无寸草，一日行过千里道。\n展处把笔欲描时，司马一騧赛倾倒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}